  (text "R30-R33 33 R series; R34-R37 10 k pull-ups (CS, MISO, DAT1, DAT2) on +3V3_SD; R38 pull-up on the detect switch (+3V3), R39 0 R link to SD_CD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 90 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9c7cb55d-b6ac-4e21-8367-e9bbb538f536"))
  (text "Card present = SD_CD low (the TF-01A switch closes to GND; confirmed on proto1). U32: SD VDD switch, R42 sets 0.45 A, R43 holds it off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 90 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8e5d76ba-25c3-4586-ba41-3d39f840606f"))
